# Discord bot token
# .NET configuration uses __ (double underscore) as section separator
DISCORD__TOKEN=your-token-here

# Optional — curl-impersonate executable used by the FreeForTheMonth plugin to bypass
# Cloudflare. Defaults to `curl_chrome116` (installed on PATH in the Docker image).
# For local/Windows dev, install a curl-impersonate build and set its full path here:
# FFM_CURL_IMPERSONATE=C:\tools\curl-impersonate\curl_chrome116.exe